<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/7/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 6 of the Dangerous Drugs (Special of section 6. Preventive Measures) Act 1985, which in this Act is Act 316. referred to as the \"principal Act\", is amended, in subsection (1), by deleting the words \"from the date of such order\". Validation of"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/7/eng@> .
